//
//  v6.11 changes — the companion 0DTE pane folded in, so it can be deleted:
//   • ABSORBED from "0DTE Regime Score — Pane": the trust-window time tint,
//     the Z1/Z2/Z3 stretch-zone entries, volume-climax marks, the longer-TF
//     backdrop row and the V-BOUNCE flag. Nothing is recomputed — the deck was
