//   • Entry/exit markers now default to OFF.
//
//  v6.10 changes:
//   • Both failure states now NAME THE DIRECTION that died — ABORT — UP FAILED
//     rather than a bare ABORT, and UP FAILED / DOWN FAILED as separate chart
//     markers. A bare "abort" left you asking which move it meant.
//   • Markers are pushed clear of the candles by a configurable stand-off in
