adrAnchor  = input.string("Rolling days", "Measure the fall from", options=["Rolling days","This week's high"], group=groupADR, tooltip="Rolling days (default): the highest high of the last N sessions. This week's high: matches the scanner convention, but it RESETS EVERY MONDAY — on 2026-06-09 the weekly anchor read 0.27 normal days at the open while the rolling one read 2.63, because the previous week's break had been wiped from the window. The reset is a blind spot, not a feature.")
