zdExhPxOn  = input.bool(true, "…and the exhaustion-fire level", group=group0dteX, tooltip="THIS IS A MARKER LOCATION, NOT AN ENTRY. Three separate studies in this project say so: the +/-8.5 reversal entry is dead unconditionally at decade scale (N=3,307, 30-minute mean +0.0 bps, REVERSAL_STUDY_REPORT.md); exhaustion is an extreme MARKER at ~2x time-matched no-skill, explicitly not an entry; and ATR stretch as a filter was directionally right but worth ~2 SPX points, 26% of the typical post-fire move (ATR_STRETCH_REPORT.md). What this line does is show WHERE the 1/2/3 mark would print — the price at which the score recovers by the pullback delta from the episode extreme. Useful for seeing the machinery coming. Trading it as a reversal is the thing that has already been measured and rejected.")
